# macOS "duplicate on copy" artefacts - "country-functions 2.js", "entities 3.json",
# "website 2/". Keeps ~25k stray duplicates out of the build context so `COPY .`
# can never publish them. Docker matches patterns against the whole context-relative
# path and `*` does not cross `/`, so each pattern is repeated under `**/`.
* [0-9]
* [0-9].*
* [0-9][0-9]
* [0-9][0-9].*
**/* [0-9]
**/* [0-9].*
**/* [0-9][0-9]
**/* [0-9][0-9].*
.warehouse-bundle
